nd serious. He lives close to Seiichi's grandfather's workshop. Forming a four people group after meeting Miyu. Seemingly relaxed, he only cuts his hair when it's too long. He lost his mother to the bloodsucker murderer a few years ago, swearing to uncover the truth behind it. Missed Seiichi after his family's relocation."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c61062"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"誠一の幼馴染。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"背が高くて寡黙。余計な冗談は言わないタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実家が誠一の祖父の工房の近くにあり、子供の頃から一緒に遊んでいた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やがて美優とも知り合い、４人で遊ぶようになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外見に気を遣わない性格で、髪の毛などは伸ばしっぱなしになっている。うっとうしくなった時が切り時というタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"過去に起きた吸血鬼事件で母親を亡くしており、真実を解明したいと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誠一が街を出てしまったのを、仕方ないと思いつつも残念に感じている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13217","sourceWorkId":"24428","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"186 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13217","sourceWorkId":"24428","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"80 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13217","sourceWorkId":"24428","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a2/a2dcfcbefa0c17dc5c58289328f15b2b457682200877cd363330ba4486228126.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fd3db4a5015e2eee63267d7fde3a677de55d2574a372dae3cdaafeecda6856a9.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐田直啓","creatorId":"vndb:s13259","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s13259","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s13259","name":"佃左泥","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:196972:133483:48609:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c61063","characterName":"水無月 さえ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"133486","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"196972"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13219"],"vndbCharacterId":"c61063"},"originalCharacterName":"水無月 さえ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"221"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A maid who has served the Kisaragi family for a long time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A member of a branch family, she has a son who works outside of Kisaragi corporation. She adopted Kazuha after the accident, treating her as granddaughter. Sae started taking care of Rei and Seiichi since their birth, treating them as her own, but her loving nature is not usually shown."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Strict, yet loyal to the Kisaragi. She assists Kanesada in contacting branch families and other businesses involving commuting. A beauty to behold when she was young."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c61063"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"如月家に仕える老家政婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の如月家の分家の一族ではあり、息子夫婦もいるが如月家のグループとは違う別の企業に勤めていて既に独立している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身寄りの無い一葉を引き取り、自分の孫として育てている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"産まれた頃から面倒を見ている零や誠一も、孫のように感じているが、普段はあまり表に出す事はない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰に対しても厳しい態度をとっているが、如月家に対する忠節は厚い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"車椅子のために外出できない当主に変わり、分家との連絡役や街での用事なども一手に引き受けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"若い時は零に面影の似た美少女で、メイド服を着ていた様子。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13219","sourceWorkId":"24428","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"162 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13219","sourceWorkId":"24428","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4e/4ea3111ad43a96a8e529932c6d6e512ca42c5a96f0dbb2569d95b056c3d72f3e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1d5f760259b98ec87642e7efd07c5e09b96869fd857b19b45d601e3cf50632c6.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"文月くん","creatorId":"vndb:s13272","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s13272","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s13272","name":"文月くん","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:196972:133486:5482:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c61064","characterName":"如月 兼定","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"133484","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"196972"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13218"],"vndbCharacterId":"c61064"},"originalCharacterName":"如月 兼定","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"8月10日"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"182"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rei's father. Married to her mother at a young age, he's still in his forties."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He lost his wife to the fire that also killed Kazuha's parents. He has since been living in a wheelchair as the result of the accident, covering scars with bandages."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Due to his poor health condition, he cannot participate in the ritual which is usually the job of the head of Kisaragi family, therefore asking Seiichi to attend for him. He wasn't expecting Seiichi to become the next head of the family. But to avoid conflict between branch families, Seiichi as a childhood friend to Rei is the perfect choice for the ritual."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He would have no opposition to Rei and Seiichi's marriage, if they too wish so. Having been cared since young, he doesn't treat Sae as a servant."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c61064"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"零の父親。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"若くして分家の娘と見合い婚をしたため、零のような大きな娘がいてもまだ４０台前半。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一葉の両親が亡くなった、過去に起きた火災事件で自らも妻を亡くし、炎に焼かれたために車椅子生活を余儀なくされている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"顔の包帯は傷を隠すための物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"如月家の儀式には当主が参加する事が義務付けられているが、体調的に難しいために誠一に協力を願い出た。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誠一を次期当主にするためではなく、他の分家だと党首の座を狙う政治抗争を加速させてしまうため、最も遠く、かつ最も娘に親しい者に代理を頼んだという事で周囲には説明している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人としては、当人同士の気持ちがあるなら、そのまま結ばれてしまっても構わないと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"先代の頃から仕えているさえには自分も子供時代から面倒をみられているため、頭が上がらない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13218","sourceWorkId":"24428","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"182 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13218","sourceWorkId":"24428","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/51/51cc38dad43b17f97a2c862ea43d46dd950df6baa2e047ab3f6dd7309b059f27.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/50efc10babadc2396b3145617038abc13f3f4367db67ef9cececb570c6ce5ca6.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"景浦大輔","creatorId":"vndb:s837","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s837","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s837","name":"景浦 大輔","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:196972:133484:4936:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c61061","characterName":"卯月 誠一","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c61061"},"originalCharacterName":"卯月 誠一","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"176"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","so